{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/783060-exactly-how-easy-hard-possible-is-it-to-kill-a-true-fae","id":783060,"title":"Exactly how easy/hard/possible is it to kill a true fae?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-09T14:43:16-08:00","id":783060,"title":"Exactly how easy/hard/possible is it to kill a true fae?","content":"I get that the gentry are massively powerful, but I assume that they can die. If only by virtue of not being the God-Machine, SOMETHING out there is more powerful than them, but I'm not finding much on what, exactly, you need to kill them, apart from cold iron doing aggravated damage. Is this one of those &quot;It's up to the story-teller&quot; things or is there some kind of official ruling I'm just not finding.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6337-someguywithakatana","name":"someguywithakatana","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-09T14:49:36-08:00","id":783062,"title":"","content":"Depends on your metric for &quot;kill.&quot; Beings who are stories are kind of difficult to say are absolutely dead when you can still talk about them, but terminating the continuity of a given manifest will is both possible and as close as you're going to get, whereupon your options are to either kill them in the seat of their power, where their advantages are chiefly limited by whether they've played the games of legend poorly or otherwise been conspired against by their peers and lessers, or somehow goad them into sending every last aspect of themselves into the nasty world of flesh and iron.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":111,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","user":"Satchel","date":". 12-09-2015, 05:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-09T14:58:57-08:00","id":783067,"title":"","content":"More Details in Autumn Nightmares, Equinox Road, and the upcoming Second Edition.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-09T15:04:34-08:00","id":783070,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/783060-exactly-how-easy-hard-possible-is-it-to-kill-a-true-fae?p=783062#post783062\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Depends on your metric for &quot;kill.&quot; Beings who are stories are kind of difficult to say are absolutely dead when you can still talk about them, but terminating the continuity of a given manifest will is both possible and as close as you're going to get, whereupon your options are to either kill them in the seat of their power, where their advantages are chiefly limited by whether they've played the games of legend poorly or otherwise been conspired against by their peers and lessers, or somehow goad them into sending every last aspect of themselves into the nasty world of flesh and iron.</div> </div> </div> </div>So other than that it's as simple (Not easy; just simple) as wailing on their bodies with enough force to break them? There's no trick to it?<br /> <br /> Because Fae being fae, I kind of assumed there was a trick to it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6337-someguywithakatana","name":"someguywithakatana","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-09T15:12:45-08:00","id":783076,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>someguywithakatana</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/783060-exactly-how-easy-hard-possible-is-it-to-kill-a-true-fae?p=783070#post783070\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So other than that it's as simple (Not easy; just simple) as wailing on their bodies with enough force to break them? There's no trick to it?<br /> <br /> Because Fae being fae, I kind of assumed there was a trick to it.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Fae can be objects that are indestructible save by a particular folkloric bane.<br /> <br /> The Fae can be packs of hunting hounds that only have an end in the death of their last member.<br /> <br /> The Fae can be vast spans of sunless desert, impossible forests, great and terrible caves, and more.<br /> <br /> The Fae can be three individuals at once, none of them obviously related.<br /> <br /> The Fae can be songs and myths and memes.<br /> <br /> The Strangers need to have all their manifestations terminated or redistributed before they can truly cease. Only the poorest of the Gentry will die just because you killed them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-09T17:53:26-08:00","id":783163,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/ma